  "title": "Pet-Friendly Living: How Veris Residential Welcomes Pets of All Shapes and Sizes",
  "summary": "As a part of the Veris Promise, we have made sure all of our residents have the option to bring a furry friend into their life. No more restrictions on dog breeds, plenty of amenities to take care of their needs, and making an overall welcoming space for felines and canines alike. There are plenty of ethical breeders ready to give a family their perfect pet, and an overabundance of animals in shelters all around the country; fur babies all equally deserving of a loving life.",
